.tox/
*.retry
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.refs/snapshot-*/
*.qcow2
.ansible/

# Private, machine-local owner docs (requirements, goals, notes) — never committed,
# but Claude still auto-loads them locally. Convention: anything *.local.md or under .local/.
*.local.md
.local/

# Live-tenant vault: the live playbooks and their .vault.yml.example templates live on the
# maintainers' bench, but keep this belt-and-braces pair — a filled-in vault must
# never be committed anywhere. The .example suffix stays safe (not matched by *.vault.yml).
*.vault.yml
!*.vault.yml.example

# Generated CI output (transient, per-commit). CI results live on the maintainers'
# bench; keep CI-RESULTS.md/.ci-logs/ as belt-and-braces so a stale,
# previously-generated artifact can never be swept into the shipped tree.
CI-RESULTS.md
.ci-logs/
artifacts/
artifacts.snap/

# SUSEConnect regcodes / registration secrets — never commit (dereg needs no regcode)
*regcode*
**/reg
linux-system-roles.json

# Editor state
.vscode/
